WEBVTT

00:14.240 --> 00:15.960
Kurumi Tokisaki!

00:15.960 --> 00:17.740
Wh-What's going on here?!

00:21.730 --> 00:23.210
Nightmare!

00:23.210 --> 00:26.000
You've finally left yourself vulnerable,

00:26.940 --> 00:28.910
Isaac Westcott.

02:20.670 --> 02:21.490
Ike!

02:24.050 --> 02:25.050
Ike!

02:25.870 --> 02:27.000
Ike!

02:30.350 --> 02:32.500
Artemisia! We're falling back!

02:32.500 --> 02:33.250
Roger!

02:44.340 --> 02:45.500
Kurumi.

02:45.500 --> 02:47.930
How do you do, Shido?

02:48.950 --> 02:51.160
What seems to be the matter?

02:51.160 --> 02:53.740
You're giving me quite the odd look.

02:53.740 --> 02:55.050
What's the matter?

02:55.050 --> 02:57.740
You mean you survived?

02:57.740 --> 03:00.570
Yes, yes, thanks to you.

03:01.380 --> 03:05.410
The moment Mio stole my Sephirah from me,

03:05.410 --> 03:12.820
I used Het to transfer my mind 
and Sephirah to a clone I created.

03:13.660 --> 03:18.030
Of course that required quite a bit 
of preparation to achieve.

03:18.430 --> 03:19.400
Then...

03:19.400 --> 03:25.180
You're currently a clone being possessed 
by the real Kurumi's personality?

03:25.180 --> 03:27.540
Something like that.

03:27.540 --> 03:29.630
More importantly right now...

03:31.230 --> 03:33.780
Zaphkiel, Dalet.

03:37.010 --> 03:41.780
Finally, I've finally obtained it.

03:52.180 --> 03:55.550
It's overflowing, it's overflowing...

03:56.460 --> 03:59.380
So this is what having 
a second Sephirah is like.

03:59.380 --> 04:03.050
I feel like I can do anything now.

04:03.820 --> 04:06.300
Kurumi, you're...

04:12.710 --> 04:13.890
What are you...?

04:13.890 --> 04:15.060
Shido!

04:15.060 --> 04:16.000
Shido!

04:16.000 --> 04:16.850
Shido!

04:16.000 --> 04:16.850
Darling!

04:16.850 --> 04:17.680
Master!

04:17.680 --> 04:18.090
Shido!

04:18.090 --> 04:18.600
Shido!

04:18.600 --> 04:19.550
Shido!

04:19.550 --> 04:21.700
I'm sorry we're late, Shido.

04:25.900 --> 04:26.970
Kurumi?!

04:26.970 --> 04:29.820
Huh?! What's going on here?!

04:29.820 --> 04:33.900
I heard that DEM was attacking Darling?!

04:35.270 --> 04:40.660
I took over the role of rescuing Shido.

04:41.300 --> 04:42.590
More importantly,

04:43.090 --> 04:48.190
it would seem an even more 
troublesome foe has to come to us.

04:50.250 --> 04:52.100
Shido, this is!

04:53.650 --> 04:54.870
Mio!

04:54.870 --> 04:57.600
Yes. I'm sorry, Shin.

04:58.890 --> 05:03.790
I still have much to learn, 
letting myself fall for that diversion.

05:04.240 --> 05:06.340
Though I'm glad you're safe.

05:06.940 --> 05:08.690
I thank you too, Kurumi.

05:09.180 --> 05:11.620
You protected Shin for me.

05:11.990 --> 05:18.910
My, my, hearing thanks from you 
only brings up awful memories.

05:22.530 --> 05:23.730
Shido!

05:23.730 --> 05:25.350
Mio is after you!

05:25.860 --> 05:28.450
So run away while we buy you some time!

05:28.800 --> 05:30.160
It's futile.

05:30.160 --> 05:34.560
Shin and I already share a connection.

05:35.010 --> 05:38.650
I know what Shin experienced in the future, too.

05:39.300 --> 05:42.660
His means of returning to the past 
won't work anymore.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.070
Shido?!

05:45.070 --> 05:47.340
Stop, she's dangerous.

05:48.170 --> 05:48.940
Mio.

05:50.740 --> 05:51.650
Shin.

05:52.080 --> 05:56.790
I couldn't seal away your Spirit power.

05:57.630 --> 06:01.290
You were in a half-state 
without all the Sephirah, after all.

06:02.890 --> 06:06.410
But I know that wasn't the only reason.

06:08.720 --> 06:12.770
I have to kiss a Spirit 
after she opens her heart to me

06:12.770 --> 06:14.210
in order to seal her Spirit power.

06:15.550 --> 06:20.260
But you still haven't opened your heart to me.

06:21.410 --> 06:22.510
Shin?

06:22.980 --> 06:24.680
What do you mean?

06:24.680 --> 06:28.930
In that moment her affection 
was definitely high enough to seal her.

06:28.930 --> 06:29.970
You're wrong.

06:29.970 --> 06:30.750
Huh?

06:32.150 --> 06:33.490
You've got it wrong.

06:33.490 --> 06:36.260
The one Mio loves isn't me.

06:36.700 --> 06:39.690
It's Shin. Shinji Takamiya.

06:41.670 --> 06:42.750
And...

06:44.700 --> 06:47.460
Shinji is no more.

06:49.890 --> 06:52.950
What are you saying, Shin?

06:54.010 --> 06:57.770
That's why I recreated you.

06:59.170 --> 07:04.070
I even granted you the power of Spirits 
so you would never die this time.

07:05.290 --> 07:08.690
Yeah, your power truly is amazing.

07:10.070 --> 07:14.230
But even if I gathered all of the Sephirah,

07:14.230 --> 07:18.060
and all of my memories 
as Shido Itsuka vanished from my mind...

07:18.860 --> 07:21.620
would I really be Shinji?

07:22.410 --> 07:26.370
I would be a person that looks like Shinji 
and possesses Shinji's memories,

07:26.370 --> 07:28.860
but that wouldn't be Shinji.

07:29.410 --> 07:32.830
Shinji's soul wouldn't be there.

07:33.910 --> 07:37.180
I'm betting you already 
understand that all too well.

07:37.950 --> 07:41.130
You understand that, 
and yet you can't help but cling to it.

07:41.990 --> 07:47.440
Though would that truly 
satisfy your heart, Mio?

07:52.130 --> 07:55.490
Why are you saying these things, Shin?

07:56.230 --> 07:58.650
You're all I have, Shin.

07:59.990 --> 08:05.340
I've lived my entire life 
to see you once again, Shin.

08:05.340 --> 08:06.960
Cut the crap!

08:08.500 --> 08:09.390
You have me!

08:09.810 --> 08:11.780
And you have all the Spirits, don't you?!

08:13.970 --> 08:19.720
Is the time we all spent together that 
inferior to the time you spent with Shinji?

08:20.450 --> 08:25.260
Oh, I get it.

08:25.980 --> 08:29.570
You're saying these things 
because you're not Shin.

08:30.250 --> 08:33.140
I need to hurry and get Shin back.

08:34.490 --> 08:36.850
Thank you for everything, Shido.

08:37.250 --> 08:38.120
But...

08:38.970 --> 08:40.990
It's time for our farewell.

08:42.840 --> 08:44.290
Sandalphon!

08:44.790 --> 08:46.720
Thanks, you saved me!

08:46.720 --> 08:48.000
Don't mention it!

08:48.000 --> 08:49.920
Though what do we do now?

08:50.290 --> 08:52.920
I'm going to kiss Mio again.

08:53.380 --> 08:54.170
Hmm?

08:54.480 --> 08:55.940
What are you saying?!

08:55.940 --> 08:59.500
You're the one who just said she 
didn't have enough affection for you!

08:59.500 --> 09:05.050
Which is why this time, I have to make her 
choose me, Shido Itsuka, instead of Shinji!

09:05.690 --> 09:08.170
Otherwise, I'm sure Mio will...

09:11.050 --> 09:12.030
Kurumi!

09:13.460 --> 09:15.650
That was a close call, wasn't it?

09:16.160 --> 09:19.760
This position is a little embarrassing...

09:19.760 --> 09:23.450
Now isn't the time to be discussing that.

09:24.350 --> 09:28.900
More importantly, that's an 
amusing idea you just proposed.

09:29.330 --> 09:32.480
Kissing Mio once again.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.620
Yeah, and I plan to.

09:34.620 --> 09:38.890
You already failed 
to seal her once, didn't you?

09:38.890 --> 09:41.270
Do you have any chance of succeeding this time?

09:46.620 --> 09:50.140
Is that Mio's true desire?

09:51.190 --> 09:56.910
Are you saying that's the reason 
she turned all of us into Spirits?!

09:57.350 --> 09:58.110
Yeah.

09:58.480 --> 10:00.540
I'm fairly certain of it.

10:03.170 --> 10:04.620
Shido.

10:13.870 --> 10:18.470
There's no means of escape 
once we're trapped in this space, right?

10:18.470 --> 10:22.400
And since Mio shares your memories,

10:22.400 --> 10:26.450
she should be able to stop Zaphkiel's 
ability to travel back in time as well.

10:27.020 --> 10:28.050
Which means

10:28.050 --> 10:32.770
we'll need to bet on the possibility 
with the greatest chances for survival.

10:33.530 --> 10:36.610
I've done this much for you already.

10:36.610 --> 10:39.150
Now be sure you see this through.

10:39.800 --> 10:40.510
Yeah.

10:40.970 --> 10:42.700
Thanks, Kurumi.

10:52.410 --> 10:58.800
My, my, you've become 
awfully good at this, Shido.

10:59.490 --> 11:00.740
<i>My body feels light.</i>

11:01.460 --> 11:03.510
<i>My entire body is brimming with power.</i>

11:04.320 --> 11:10.060
<i>I see. Now I truly have the power 
of all 10 Sephirah within me.</i>

11:10.530 --> 11:12.060
Now I can pull this off!

11:12.740 --> 11:13.560
Shin!

11:32.580 --> 11:33.580
Shido!

11:33.580 --> 11:34.170
Boy!

11:34.170 --> 11:35.340
Brother!

11:34.540 --> 11:35.340
Master!

11:34.540 --> 11:35.340
Darling!

11:46.540 --> 11:47.420
Ike!

11:48.150 --> 11:50.100
Ike, are you all right?

11:50.100 --> 11:51.140
Ike!

11:56.500 --> 12:01.950
So that is what it feels like to have 
a Qlipha yanked out while still alive.

12:02.510 --> 12:05.370
That was a valuable experience.

12:05.680 --> 12:07.950
Is this any time for jokes?!

12:08.590 --> 12:10.120
What's the situation?

12:10.570 --> 12:14.610
It seems Nightmare has entrusted 
her power to Shido Itsuka.

12:14.610 --> 12:16.060
And Goetia?

12:16.060 --> 12:18.790
It's still next to Fraxinus.

12:18.790 --> 12:21.000
Remote control hasn't been cut off.

12:21.000 --> 12:22.630
I see.

12:24.340 --> 12:27.670
Then all is going smoothly, right?

12:30.340 --> 12:31.260
Kotori!

12:31.730 --> 12:33.540
Are you all right?!

12:34.370 --> 12:37.580
Yes, I wasn't injured.

12:37.580 --> 12:39.350
I just hit my time limit.

12:39.830 --> 12:40.780
More importantly...

12:42.780 --> 12:44.250
What's this?

12:44.250 --> 12:46.910
Perplexed. What is happening here?

12:47.280 --> 12:50.530
Kotori, Shido is safe, right?

12:50.530 --> 12:51.930
Of course.

12:51.930 --> 12:55.230
Shido wouldn't go down 
from something like this.

12:55.230 --> 12:57.430
Yeah, you're right.

12:57.430 --> 12:58.790
Nia, can you hear me?

12:59.210 --> 13:01.690
Bring the monitoring equipment here.

13:02.550 --> 13:03.220
<b>Analyzing</b>

13:03.220 --> 13:03.800
<b>Complete</b>

13:04.280 --> 13:06.420
Mmn, it's no use.

13:06.420 --> 13:07.790
No way!

13:08.940 --> 13:13.140
Nia, please leave this part to me.

13:13.140 --> 13:14.310
Kurumin!

13:15.020 --> 13:15.990
Raziel!

13:18.870 --> 13:20.250
That's possible?!

13:20.250 --> 13:21.690
I mean, well,

13:21.690 --> 13:26.170
I guess it would be after that villainous 
president took my Sephirah, but still-

13:26.170 --> 13:27.700
Quiet.

13:28.060 --> 13:32.950
It's my first time using this Angel, 
so please let me focus.

13:32.950 --> 13:36.290
Ngh, I'm getting NTR'd?!

13:36.290 --> 13:38.710
So humiliating!

13:39.350 --> 13:41.510
Can you tell how Shido's doing?

13:41.510 --> 13:42.460
Yes.

13:42.970 --> 13:44.970
It seems he's safe.

13:48.180 --> 13:49.370
What's this?

14:20.290 --> 14:21.590
Right!

14:21.930 --> 14:23.330
Where is everyone?!

14:23.330 --> 14:24.250
Shin.

14:25.290 --> 14:27.420
R-Reine?!

14:27.420 --> 14:29.700
Wh-What's going on here?!

14:30.100 --> 14:31.210
Where is everyone?

14:31.600 --> 14:32.970
Where's Fraxinus?

14:33.750 --> 14:34.720
Give me your hand.

14:34.720 --> 14:35.500
Huh?

14:36.150 --> 14:37.820
S-Sure.

14:43.900 --> 14:45.310
Thank you.

14:45.810 --> 14:48.360
Hey! Here, over here!

14:48.690 --> 14:49.420
Huh?

14:50.890 --> 14:51.910
Mio?

14:52.940 --> 14:53.740
And...?

15:01.890 --> 15:03.690
M-Me?

15:05.220 --> 15:07.060
No, it's not.

15:07.530 --> 15:08.720
You're...

15:09.550 --> 15:10.390
Shin?

15:10.860 --> 15:13.490
Shinji Takamiya?

15:13.490 --> 15:14.290
Yeah.

15:14.950 --> 15:19.330
I guess I should say nice to meet you?

15:26.500 --> 15:28.970
What is this...?

15:28.970 --> 15:33.630
It would seem to be a space created by Ein Sof.

15:35.280 --> 15:36.980
It seems to be?

15:37.460 --> 15:41.060
There's a connection between you and me.

15:41.660 --> 15:46.290
It seems like our shared memories 
are being recreated through that.

15:47.150 --> 15:51.810
In doing so, I think it separated our minds 
into me and Mio plus you and Shin,

15:52.260 --> 15:58.330
in order to create a state 
more closely resembling those memories.

15:58.770 --> 16:00.770
I-I see?

16:01.060 --> 16:02.600
Isn't this kind of thing nice?

16:02.970 --> 16:04.400
More importantly, let's have fun?

16:04.400 --> 16:06.410
Since we're at the beach and all.

16:27.620 --> 16:30.330
You've done it now!

16:32.030 --> 16:33.060
Take that!

16:51.190 --> 16:54.400
Are you losing the sense that you were Shin?

16:54.400 --> 16:57.930
Huh?! Can you read my mind in this space?!

16:57.930 --> 16:59.550
That wasn't it.

17:00.060 --> 17:03.210
I just figured you were like myself.

17:03.700 --> 17:04.540
Huh?

17:05.010 --> 17:09.520
I suppose the emotions I held as Mio 
might have gone into that Mio

17:09.520 --> 17:12.420
when our existences were separated.

17:13.780 --> 17:15.630
It's a strange feeling.

17:17.190 --> 17:23.570
It really feels like I'm Reine Murasame, 
a separate person from Mio Takamiya.

17:26.510 --> 17:27.650
Reine...

17:29.430 --> 17:31.700
It really feels nice, doesn't it?

17:32.980 --> 17:36.890
I should thank you for bringing me here, Shin.

17:36.890 --> 17:39.030
I'm just glad you're enjoying it.

17:40.090 --> 17:43.650
I worked pretty hard to find 
a place with nice scenery.

17:46.310 --> 17:47.260
Shido.

17:48.110 --> 17:49.330
I'm all right.

17:49.690 --> 17:53.860
Oh, I wanted to try that! Those fireworks!

17:53.860 --> 17:56.170
You have to light fireworks 
when you visit the beach, right?

17:56.750 --> 18:00.800
We were home by evening last time 
we came here, so we couldn't do it.

18:00.800 --> 18:02.780
I-I couldn't help it.

18:03.250 --> 18:06.220
We had to leave by then 
or it would've gotten too late,

18:06.220 --> 18:08.060
and we would've worried Mana,

18:08.590 --> 18:10.360
as well as give people the wrong idea.

18:11.270 --> 18:14.810
That just means there's more fun 
to be had in the future, right?

18:14.810 --> 18:17.690
I want to try diving and having a barbecue, too.

18:17.690 --> 18:20.350
Let's try out lots and lots more things?

18:20.670 --> 18:25.370
I'm sure it'll be fun with you, 
me, Reine, and Shido!

18:29.580 --> 18:33.150
I honestly wish this time could last forever.

18:35.930 --> 18:37.820
Yeah, that's true.

18:39.210 --> 18:41.950
But nothing lasts forever.

18:42.620 --> 18:45.270
Isn't that right, Mio?

18:47.990 --> 18:48.750
Mio.

18:50.650 --> 18:51.550
I'm sorry.

18:52.370 --> 18:55.050
I made you say that, didn't I?

19:03.990 --> 19:09.540
When I first kissed Reine, 
your memories as Mio flowed into me.

19:10.540 --> 19:13.780
I couldn't understand what they were,

19:13.780 --> 19:16.250
and I didn't understand what they meant,

19:17.580 --> 19:18.420
but...

19:21.450 --> 19:22.450
Now I finally...

19:23.770 --> 19:25.980
I finally understand.

19:30.440 --> 19:31.310
Mio.

19:32.740 --> 19:37.130
You gave birth to me in order to 
bring the dead Shinji back to life.

19:38.220 --> 19:39.190
Isn't that right?

19:40.950 --> 19:43.290
But that wasn't all.

19:43.890 --> 19:49.080
Because you knew the Shinji created 
that way wouldn't be the real Shinji.

19:51.650 --> 19:55.070
I'm not sure if you were 
conscious of it or not,

19:55.770 --> 19:59.540
but after seeing your memories, 
I learned something.

20:01.190 --> 20:07.790
Mio, you gave birth to me 
to create a being that could kill you.

20:16.230 --> 20:17.850
How is it, Kurumi?!

20:18.580 --> 20:26.990
On the shore there's Shido, Mio, 
Ms. Murasame, and another Shido?

20:26.990 --> 20:30.410
Hmm? Did you say there are two of Master?

20:30.900 --> 20:32.250
That's strange.

20:32.250 --> 20:35.540
Also, Mio and Reine are separated?

20:35.540 --> 20:40.210
Suspicious. Was that cocoon 
capable of reproduction?

20:40.780 --> 20:43.650
I won't know without looking into it.

20:44.030 --> 20:46.140
Why did they end up like that?

20:51.020 --> 20:52.410
Wh-What?!

20:52.410 --> 20:54.280
An extremely strong spirit wave.

20:54.280 --> 20:55.760
But where did it come from?

20:55.760 --> 20:57.020
Everyone, over there!

21:00.900 --> 21:01.880
Origami!

21:01.880 --> 21:02.820
Mana!

21:03.180 --> 21:05.540
They're definitely plotting something!

21:05.540 --> 21:06.780
I'll go eliminate them!

21:08.530 --> 21:09.530
Metatron!

21:17.750 --> 21:18.920
It's no use.

21:19.250 --> 21:21.610
The spell has already been activated.

21:22.170 --> 21:23.320
I'm sorry.

21:23.320 --> 21:24.670
Looks like this is the end.

21:25.550 --> 21:29.950
Yes, I believed in you, Shido Itsuka.

21:31.180 --> 21:35.180
I knew you would surely stop Deus for me.

21:43.390 --> 21:45.700
Rejoice, everyone!

21:46.220 --> 21:52.330
You all get to witness the birth 
of a second Spirit of Origin!

21:52.740 --> 21:55.000
<b>Episode 11</b>

21:52.740 --> 21:55.000
<b>A Fleeting Paradise</b>

23:25.000 --> 23:40.020
Episode 12: "And The One She Chooses Is"

23:26.000 --> 23:28.420
The time to settle things has finally arrived.

23:28.420 --> 23:33.190
What conclusion will the love 
between Shinji, Mio, and Shido lead to?

23:33.510 --> 23:36.680
The final episode, 
"And The One She Chooses Is".

23:36.680 --> 23:39.680
Now, let's head out on our last date.
